flowchart TD
Start["Receive locator<br/>Explicit timeout and polling"]
Find["Re-find element<br/>Missing / stale -> poll again<br/>Other errors -> fail"]
Ready["Check readiness<br/>Visible + enabled + positive box<br/>Center hit-test unobscured<br/>Bounding rectangle stable"]
Poll["Not ready<br/>Deadline not elapsed: poll<br/>Deadline elapsed: timeout"]
Click["Perform one WebDriver click<br/>Return or surface click failure"]
Start --> Find
Find --> Ready
Ready -->|false| Poll
Ready -->|true| Click
